     A** REVIEW ID FILE
     A*****************************************************************
     A**   DESCRIPTION:                                               *
     A**     This file will contain the Tax ID# and Group Type for    *
     A**      processing WC group checks.                             *
     A*****************************************************************
     A**   REVISIONS:                                                 *
     A**                                                              *
     A**  04/07/04  C:62  PROJECT: WC1220                             *
     A**                  ADD PRINT CHECK DETAIL FLAG                 *
     A**                                                              *
     A**  09/28/94  C:15  PROJECT: WC361                              *
     A**                  ADDED FIELDS FOR THE NETWORK FEE % AND THE  *
     A**                  BILL REVIEW %.                              *
     A**                                                              *
     A**  08/02/93  C:06  PROJECT: AUU                                *
     A**                  ADDED FLAG FIELD TO INDICATE IF A PROVIDER  *
     A**                  IS TO BE INVOICED THRU MANAGE CARE (NRFLG1).*
     A**                  ALSO ADD 4 ADDITIONAL FLAGS FOR FUTURE USE. *
     A**                                                              *
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PNR01                     TEXT('NETWORK REVIEW FILE')
     A            NRCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            NRFEIN    R               REFFLD(FEIN)
     A                                      COLHDG('TAX ID')
     A            NRMOD     R               REFFLD(MOD)
     A                                      COLHDG('TAX ID MOD')
     A            NRNAME    R               REFFLD(NAME)
     A            NRFSN     R               REFFLD(FSN)
     A            NRGRTY    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('GROUP TYPE' 'B/N/O')
     A*                                            B = Bill Review
     A*                                            N = PPO Network
     A*                                            O = Other (Claim Scan, Atty)
     A            NRSTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A            NRUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      TEXT('MAINTENANCE USER')
     A            NRPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      TEXT('MAINTENANCE PGM')
     A            NRTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      TEXT('MAINTENANCE TIME')
     A            NRDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      TEXT('MAINTENANCE DATE')
     A            NRIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      TEXT('INITIAL USER')
     A            NRIDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      TEXT('INITIAL DATE')
     A*
     A*** BEG ADD **************** 08/02/93 **************** C:06 *******
     A            NRFLG1    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('M/C INVOICE')
     A            NRFLG2    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      TEXT('FUTURE USE')
     A            NRFLG3    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      TEXT('FUTURE USE')
     A            NRFLG4    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      TEXT('FUTURE USE')
     A            NRFLG5    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      TEXT('FUTURE USE')
     A*** BEGIN ADD *** 09/28/94 ****************************************
     A            NRNTWF    R               REFFLD(PC54)
     A                                      TEXT('NETWORK FEE %')
     A            NRBLRF    R               REFFLD(PC54)
     A                                      TEXT('BILL REVIEW %')
     A*** END ADD ***** 09/28/94 ****************************************
     A*** BEGIN ADD *** 04/07/04 ****************************************
     A            NRCHKD    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      TEXT('PRINT CHECK DETAIL')
